# PROBE class-assertion-inconsistent. B(a) and C(a) with B disjoint C: the ABox is inconsistent.
# construct: ClassAssertion
# expect: inconsistent

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual .
:B owl:disjointWith :C .
:a a :B , :C .
